# In the nunc-stans monorepo, engines/nunc-fluens holds the news pipeline CODE only. The
# world source of truth (data) lives in the external ~/news repo, which runs
# the live daily pipeline (see INTEGRATION.md). Everything below is either
# runtime byproduct or world-SoR data and must never be committed here — a
# single pipeline run would otherwise add ~900 MB of graph snapshots back.
# Patterns are anchored (leading /) so the committed golden fixtures under
# pipeline/goldens/input/ — which reuse these directory names — stay tracked
# (Phase C T1; CI stages them back into these ignored paths via stage-ci).
/app/data/
/app/sourcedata/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
/app/.pytest_cache/
/docs/data/
/memory/
/future-prediction/
/report/
/references.txt
